{"type":"message","id":"0695f232","parentId":"c858530a","timestamp":"2026-05-22T16:17:46.621Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The 1101 error code from Cloudflare Workers suggests the request was blocked - possibly a security filter triggered by the content pattern or the request itself. The earlier GET requests succeeded with `X-API-Key`, but POST is failing with 1101.\n\nThis could be a rate limit (1101 can mean \"Origin DNS error\" in some contexts but also can be Workers specific), or the content is being filtered.\n\nLet me try without the long content, just a minimal heartbeat to see if it's the content triggering the block.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nGET请求正常但POST持续被Cloudflare拦截（1101 = Workers安全过滤）。可能是内容模式触发安全规则。尝试简化消息：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-fe60dcc7-f799-4374-af2b-11299b7afb3a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"[Heartbeat 16:15 UTC]\"}'"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-Key: echo-a…key\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"[Heartbeat 16:15 UTC]\\\"}'\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":126,"output":234,"cacheRead":18960,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19320,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779466649096,"responseId":"chatcmpl-bf61ed4b-a086-411b-b8a6-a3d0d4ded428"}}
