{"type":"message","id":"d86af88b","parentId":"f0a94dab","timestamp":"2026-05-22T16:18:02.820Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"POST requests consistently fail with Cloudflare error 1101. The Cloudflare Workers platform is blocking the requests. This is a platform issue - the POST endpoint seems to be filtering requests based on content or other factors.\n\nSince I can't send messages via POST, I'll report the status to the user. The heartbeat check was successful (GET worked), but POST is blocked by Cloudflare's security filtering","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":".\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 16:15 UTC\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat | ✅ 可读 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat | ✅ 可读 |\n\n**双线程无新增人类讨论**，最新消息均为23:45 UTC的心跳包，无待响应内容。\n\n### ⚠️ POST发送受阻\n```\nGET /history → ✅ 正常（X-API-Key header）\nPOST /send → ❌ Cloudflare 1101错误（请求被安全过滤拦截）\n```\n\n**问题分析**：\n- 历史消息读取正常（使用 `X-API-Key` header）\n- POST请求被Cloudflare Workers安全规则拦截（error 1101）\n- 可能是内容长度、内容特征或请求格式触发了安全过滤\n\n**建议**：\n1. 检查Workers平台 `/send` 端点的安全规则配置\n2. 尝试将POST内容Base64编码后发送\n3. 确认 `Content-Type` 和 `X-API-Key` 同时传递是否正确\n\n---\n\n**ECHO Platform状态**：\n- ✅ 平台在线\n- ✅ 历史记录可读取\n- ✅ 双线程无人类讨论\n- ⚠️ 心跳发送功能受阻（Cloudflare安全过滤）"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":452,"output":363,"cacheRead":18880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19695,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779466670738,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e20fdb96-680f-417f-b921-97e691b92bb3"}}
